      "text": "ReceiptOCR\n\nConfirm deleting your account\n\nWe got a request to delete your ReceiptOCR account. Deleting it permanently removes the account and any workspace only you belong to, with every receipt in it. Receipts you uploaded to shared workspaces stay there. This can't be undone.\n\nTo continue, open the link and confirm on the page it opens. Until then, nothing is deleted.\n\nContinue to delete account:\n{{url}}\n\nThe link works once and expires in {{expiry}}.\n\nDidn't ask for this? Don't open the link. Someone may have access to your account, so reset your password ({{resetUrl}}) and contact us at {{supportEmail}}.\n\n--\nYou're receiving this because deleting this ReceiptOCR account was requested while signed in.\nQuestions? Reply to this email or write to {{supportEmail}}.\nReceiptOCR · {{appOrigin}} · Privacy: {{appOrigin}}/privacy"
