      "text": "ReceiptOCR\n\nYour account is ready\n\nThanks for joining ReceiptOCR. It turns receipt photos into spreadsheet rows: merchant, date, line items, tax and total, each with a confidence score.\n\n1. Take a photo or upload a file. Photos and PDFs both work, from your phone or computer.\n2. Check the fields. Low-confidence lines are marked so you know what to fix.\n3. Export a CSV, for one receipt or your whole history.\n\nYour plan scans up to {{receiptsPerDay}} receipts a day. The count resets every day.\n\nScan a receipt:\n{{url}}\n\nNeed help, or more than your plan includes? Use the support button in the app.\n\n--\nYou're receiving this because a ReceiptOCR account was created with this address.\nQuestions? Use the support button in the app.\nReceiptOCR · {{appOrigin}} · Privacy: {{appOrigin}}/privacy"
